# Step 1+ build outputs.  The raw .sqlite is derived from the tracked
# .encoded form via `python3 webhelper/encoded_codec.py decode`; the
# .encoded form ships with the branch so users can drop it straight
# into project knowledge without re-running the bulk catalogue.
Library_Catalog.sqlite
dist/
build/

# Library_Catalog.json is deprecated as authoritative on this branch
# (post-Step 6) — SQLite is the source of truth.  The JSON stays as a
# one-time conversion input for `catalogue.py --export-sqlite`, but we
# no longer track changes to it on this branch.  The Code-side workflow
# on `main` continues to track and update it.
Library_Catalog.json
Library_Index.json
